striped-hyena-neuron
StripedHyena 7B (StripedHyena 1) inference on AWS Trainium 2 with PyTorch Native (TorchNeuron).

This package is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE).

It includes, unmodified, files from:
  togethercomputer/stripedhyena (https://github.com/togethercomputer/stripedhyena)
  commit 7e13f618027fea9625be1f2d2d94f9a361f6bd02, Apache License 2.0, Copyright Together Computer:
    striped_hyena_neuron/_vendor/stripedhyena/*.py
    striped_hyena_neuron/_vendor/stripedhyena_configs/7b-sh-32k-v1.yml
    striped_hyena_neuron/_vendor/tokenizer.json
  (license text: striped_hyena_neuron/_vendor/LICENSE.stripedhyena)

It includes a modified copy of one function from the AWS Neuron NKI Library (nkilib, Apache License 2.0):
    striped_hyena_neuron/kernels/nkilib_mlp_compat.py  (_perform_intermediate_transpose; used only with the
    earlier NKI 0.7 frontend (torch-neuronx 2.13); a no-op on NKI 0.7.0 GA / Neuron SDK 2.33)

Files adapted from the Evo 2 Trainium decode package (evo2_neuron_decode, Apache License 2.0) carry a header naming
their source file; see PROVENANCE.md.

Model weights are NOT included: togethercomputer/StripedHyena-Hessian-7B and togethercomputer/StripedHyena-Nous-7B
(Apache License 2.0) are downloaded from the Hugging Face Hub.
